              "content": "=\"\"\"\n{{ $json.chatInput }}\n\"\"\"\n\nBase on the summary meeting notes, take action items and turn it into json.\n\n## Rules:\n0. Always start task name with verb.\n1. **Field mapping**\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"taskName\": Task Name,\n    \"size\": \"S\" || \"M\" || \"L\" || \"XL\",\n    \"priority\": \"🧊 Low\", \"🧀 Medium\", \"🚨HIGH\",\n    \"kanbanTag\": \"Task\" || \"Epic\" || \"User Story\" || \"Hotfix\" ,\n    \"kanbanStage\": \"BACKLOG\" || \"TO-DO\",\n    \"AC\": Acceptance Criteria,\n    \"due\": Date (yyyy-MM-dd)\n  }\n]\n```\n2. **Defaults (if not mentioned)**\n - T-shirt Size: S\n - Priority: 🧊 Low\n - Kanban - Tag: Task\n - Kanban - Stage: BACKLOG\n - AC: empty\n - Due: empty\n3. **Date format**:\n - “next Friday”: `{{ $now.startOf('week').plus(1, 'week').plus(5, 'day').format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}`\n - \"2 weeks\": `{{ $today.plus(2, 'week').format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}\n\n## Final-notes:\n - Today date: {{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}"
